// Demo workflow: exists so the dashboard has something visibly in flight.
//
// Po11y learns that a workflow is running by asking n8n for its running
// executions once per POLL_INTERVAL. A workflow that finishes in less time
// than one interval can start and end between two polls, so it is counted but
// never seen running. Every other example workflow finishes in a few seconds,
// which makes the live indicator impossible to demonstrate on a fresh install.
//
// This one holds an execution open for 20 seconds of every minute, so a poll
// lands inside a run often enough to watch the indicator appear and clear.
// Zero credentials, no outbound calls, no data produced beyond this stamp.
return [{ json: { beat_at: new Date().toISOString(), held_seconds: 20 } }];
